                <articleBody jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="company/components/text" textIsRich="true"
                    text="&lt;h2&gt;Start Strong, Stay Consistent&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strength training doesn't need to be complicated. Master a handful of compound lifts, add weight gradually, and stay consistent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Squat, hinge, push, pull&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3 full-body sessions per week&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2-4 sets of 5-8 reps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Add a little weight each week&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Focus on technique first - load follows form.&lt;/p&gt;"/>
